WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.290
- Well, I have to ask
about another big movie

00:00:02.290 --> 00:00:03.320
that you've got coming this fall

00:00:03.320 --> 00:00:04.890
cause I'm a nerd about Marvel.

00:00:04.890 --> 00:00:07.930
And Marvel's "The Eternals"
I mean you're in that.

00:00:07.930 --> 00:00:08.981
So, how cool is that?

00:00:08.981 --> 00:00:13.260
- That's like a shocking,
it's beyond cool.

00:00:13.260 --> 00:00:14.880
I think, it's a miracle.

00:00:14.880 --> 00:00:16.830
(Kelly laughs)

00:00:16.830 --> 00:00:18.670
- And I love it, that I'm in the one

00:00:18.670 --> 00:00:21.639
Marvel movie that is completely diverse.

00:00:21.639 --> 00:00:23.008
- [Kelly] I love that.

00:00:23.008 --> 00:00:24.470
- And it's very different
than all the other ones.

00:00:24.470 --> 00:00:27.570
- I'm gonna love it I am such a freak fan

00:00:27.570 --> 00:00:30.190
for all of it and I
don't think it's crazy.

00:00:30.190 --> 00:00:32.970
I'm not behind the scenes in
the actor world or whatever.

00:00:32.970 --> 00:00:35.320
So I don't know like as
far as casting but I think

00:00:35.320 --> 00:00:37.530
it's so normal to see you
in something like that.

00:00:37.530 --> 00:00:39.030
So, but you've say it-

00:00:39.030 --> 00:00:41.790
- But Kelly, can I ask
you a question, I'm sorry.

00:00:41.790 --> 00:00:42.884
- [Kelly] Yeah.

00:00:42.884 --> 00:00:44.151
- I know I'm not supposed
to be interviewing you

00:00:44.151 --> 00:00:49.151
but how cool it is that
our director for that movie

00:00:50.860 --> 00:00:54.570
it's the second woman that actually

00:00:54.570 --> 00:00:56.820
wins an Oscar for best director.

00:00:56.820 --> 00:00:57.653
(audience clapping)

00:00:57.653 --> 00:00:58.503
- That's amazing.

00:00:59.400 --> 00:01:02.182
- [Selma] That's amazing,
Yeah, I'm super proud.

00:01:02.182 --> 00:01:04.500
- [Kelly] Wow, I bet, no, that's
amazing, that's incredible.

00:01:04.500 --> 00:01:05.670
- [Selma] Innovation.

00:01:05.670 --> 00:01:08.890
- Exactly. And it's like
such great progress.

00:01:08.890 --> 00:01:10.620
Like I think sometimes we get, you know

00:01:10.620 --> 00:01:12.380
kind of bummed out a bit as females too

00:01:12.380 --> 00:01:14.640
like, as far as equal pay and other things

00:01:14.640 --> 00:01:16.290
like in the entertainment industry.

00:01:16.290 --> 00:01:18.370
And it's really cool when
we like focus on that

00:01:18.370 --> 00:01:20.670
the positive things like
that, that's really cool.

00:01:20.670 --> 00:01:23.380
I cannot wait to see it,
I'm very excited, no joke.

00:01:23.380 --> 00:01:25.336
Everyone here will tell you
I'm a nerd about Marvel stuff.

00:01:25.336 --> 00:01:26.169
So

